#: Game.Levels.ArgWorld.L01_arg
msgid "## **Level 1**\n"
"Lean natively is aware of the valid argument known as **modus ponens**. In fact, Lean has a funny way of interpreting...\n"
"## **Implications as functions**\n"
"We have §0. We can think of this implication as being a function, whose input is (a proof of) §1 and whose output is (a proof of) §2. So we should be able to obtain a new hypothesis in our situation here, namely §3. But how to do this?"
msgstr ""

